---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const effectiveDate = 'September 24, 2026';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Vernacular Labs collects, uses, and protects information, including for research-study participants and text messages.">
  <section class="container-site pt-14 md:pt-20 pb-6">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Privacy Policy</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.25rem,5vw,4rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] max-w-4xl">
      How we handle your information.
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-[14px] text-ash">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-site">
    <article class="legal">
      <p>
        This policy explains what information Vernacular Labs collects, why we collect it, and the
        choices you have. It covers this website and the research studies we run, including the
        scheduling page you may reach from a text message invitation.
      </p>

      <h2 id="who-we-are">Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Vernacular Labs LLC (&ldquo;Vernacular Labs&rdquo;) is a research organization that conducts
        opinion research through one-on-one phone interviews. When this policy says &ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our,&rdquo; it means
        Vernacular Labs. You can reach us at
        <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 id="what-we-collect">What we collect and why</h2>
      <p>If you are invited to take part in one of our research studies, we may collect the following.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Name and phone number.</strong> We get these from public voter registration records
          and use them to invite people to take part in a study.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Booking record.</strong> When you schedule a call, we record the time you chose,
          the version of the consent text you agreed to, when you agreed, your IP address, and your
          browser type. We keep this so we can call you at the right time and keep a record of
          your consent.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Interview recording and transcript.</strong> We record the audio of the research
          interview and produce a written transcript of it, so we can analyze what people tell us.
          Interviews may be conducted by an automated, AI-generated voice interviewer.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Honorarium delivery status.</strong> Your $50 honorarium is sent by text to the
          phone number on your booking, through our payment provider: $10 shortly after the call
          starts, and $40 when the interview is done. We keep a record of whether each payment was
          sent and delivered.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Text message delivery status.</strong> We keep a record of whether the texts we
          send you were delivered.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you write to us through this website&rsquo;s contact form or by email, we use what you send
        us to reply to you.
      </p>

      <h2 id="how-we-use-it">How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To conduct and analyze opinion research.</li>
        <li>To schedule and conduct your interview.</li>
        <li>To verify that an interview was completed and deliver your honorarium.</li>
        <li>To keep records of the consent you gave us.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="sharing">Who we share it with</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Service providers.</strong> We use companies that act on our behalf to provide
          telephony, text messaging, payment delivery, and cloud hosting. They receive only the
          information they need to provide those services to us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Research findings.</strong> We report what we learn in aggregate, or with
          identifying details removed.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>As required by law.</strong> We may disclose information if we are required to
          by law or legal process.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>We do not sell personal information.</strong></p>

      <h2 id="text-messages">Text messages (SMS)</h2>
      <h3>How we get your consent</h3>
      <p>
        We ask for your consent to receive texts on our scheduling page, through a checkbox that
        is unchecked by default and that you must tick yourself before booking. Consent to receive
        texts is not a condition of any purchase.
      </p>
      <h3>What we send</h3>
      <p>After you book a call, we send only messages about that call:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>a confirmation of your booking;</li>
        <li>a reminder 24 hours before your call;</li>
        <li>a reminder one hour before your call;</li>
        <li>a confirmation if you change or cancel your time; and</li>
        <li>a link to pick another time if we miss you.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Your honorarium arrives in separate texts sent by our payment provider. We do not send
        marketing messages.
      </p>
      <h3>How often</h3>
      <p>
        Message frequency varies, usually 2 to 4 texts per booking. Message and data rates may apply.
      </p>
      <h3>Opting out and getting help</h3>
      <p>
        Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any of our texts to opt out at any time. Reply
        <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or email us at
        <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a>.
      </p>
      <h3>Your mobile information</h3>
      <p>
        No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.
      </p>

      <h2 id="retention">How long we keep it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Interview recordings and transcripts are kept for the duration of the research program,
          and then deleted or de-identified.
        </li>
        <li>Consent and payment records are kept as required for audit.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="your-choices">Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Stop texts.</strong> Reply STOP to any message from us, or email
          <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Ask what we hold, or ask us to delete it.</strong> Email
          <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a> and tell us the phone
          number we contacted you at. We will respond to your request.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="changes">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy, we will post the new version on this page and update the
        effective date above.
      </p>

      <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Vernacular Labs LLC &middot; <a href="mailto:info@vernacularlabs.ai">info@vernacularlabs.ai</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
